# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository on every platform.
# Linux CI runs the Makefile (bash recipes) and the framework's shell tooling;
# CRLF would break shebangs and `make` parsing. Storing LF everywhere keeps the
# repo deterministic whether contributors are on Windows, macOS, or Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles are text but should never be merged by hand.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
uv.lock        -diff

# Binary assets Git must not touch.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
